      "side": 1,
      "message": "So this could be a bool, though I am unsure of how it would be best used.\nThe flag could be \u0027enable-at-boot\u0027 or something like that.\nThere is no need to have a \u0027disable at boot\u0027, because interrupts by default\nare not enabled until they are.\nThough I have to ask the question whether there are signals that are not enabled at boot by default, when do they get enabled? Or disabled?",
