      "writtenOn": "2022-02-11T13:00:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is best to divide the structures into a RO config and a RW data structure.\nAll of the fixed config (well, everything except intr_cb) into one structure and make sure it is const,\nand have an array of struct gpio_callback for the RW callback data.",
      "revId": "524a8d1e50f3a1374a3cd3403b4406552039b80e",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
