      "message": "This should be hooked up with the zephyr APIs (IRQ_CONNECT()) rather than exported as a global symbol and hooked up with the legacy bindings as is being done in https://crrev.com/c/3389663/.",
      "revId": "524a8d1e50f3a1374a3cd3403b4406552039b80e",
