      "writtenOn": "2022-02-17T05:01:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure about this, may I get more details? The document has IRQ_CONNECT(irq_p, priority_p, isr_p, isr_param_p, flags_p), I don\u0027t find informaton about some parameter, like the irq_p, available to power sequencing module. In NPCX driver they use this, but couldn\u0027t take it as an example here.",
