      "writtenOn": "2022-02-17T05:39:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looking at `irq_connect_dynamic` in `arch/riscv/core/irq_manage.c`:\n\n* irq_p: IRQ number (vector table index, I believe)\n* priority_p: PLIC priority (only relevant for cores that have a PLIC)\n* isr_p: pointer to ISR function\n* isr_param_p: value passed to isr_p as a void* (`void (*isr_p)(void *isr_param_p)`)\n* flags_p: unused on RISC-V, can be 0",
      "parentUuid": "06b631e5_55b7b75f",
      "revId": "524a8d1e50f3a1374a3cd3403b4406552039b80e",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
