        "id": 1361259
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-02-17T05:47:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since this function handles GPIO interrupts though, I think we actually want to call `gpio_pin_interrupt_configure_dt` during initialization for each pin that we want to interrupt on; no need to hook up IRQs, since the GPIO driver handles that.",
      "parentUuid": "8269f5d4_f2536db3",
      "revId": "524a8d1e50f3a1374a3cd3403b4406552039b80e",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
